# Copy to .env and fill in. agent.py loads .env from this directory at startup.
# A real .env holds a live secret: keep it out of version control.
#
# This must be an Anthropic API key, from:
#   https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
#
# A Claude Code / Claude.ai subscription will NOT work here. That credential
# authenticates Claude Code itself; API traffic from your own applications is a
# separate product with separate billing. There is no way to point this agent at
# a subscription.
#
# If you would rather not keep a key on disk at all, skip this file entirely:
#   ant auth login
#   .venv/bin/python agent.py --auth oauth

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
